    narr:narration """The establishment of the Meridian deployment gate is framed as a [declarative policy shift](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1) initiated by Quinton Fairweather. This requirement, which mandates a signed release manifest for all shipments, is subsequently codified through an [editorial summary](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3) that formalizes the gate's [technical parameters](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4). The operational scope is explicitly defined to [encompass both staging and production environments](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5), with Fairweather identified as the [sole owner of the decision](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_6). The discourse surrounding this gate relies on a matter-of-fact, authoritative register, positioning the requirement as a non-negotiable precondition for deployment rather than a procedural recommendation.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ;
